        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Qazi Touqeer, Ruprekha Banerjee, Rex D'Souza\n- Places: Srinagar, Kolkata, India\n- Events: Fame Gurukul\n- Roles: singer, finalist, winner\n\nFacts:\n- Qazi Touqeer was born on 2 June 1992 in Srinagar.\n- Ruprekha Banerjee was born in 1984 in Kolkata.\n- Qazi Touqeer is a Kashmiri singer.\n- Fame Gurukul was one of the most watched television shows in India.\n- Ruprekha Banerjee, Rex D'Souza, and Qazi Touqeer were the three finalists of Fame Gurukul.\n- Qazi Touqeer and Ruprekha Banerjee won Fame Gurukul.",
